{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"6A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i","title":"告子上","description":"告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"受","id":"受"},{"form":"弗","id":"弗"},{"form":"思","id":"思"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"放","id":"放"},{"form":"死","id":"死"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"甚","id":"甚"},{"form":"由","id":"由"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"舍","id":"舍"},{"form":"身","id":"身"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"鄉","id":"郷"},{"form":"養","id":"養"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.07791843709245568,"source":"養","target":"人"},{"weight":1.430311246536665,"source":"養","target":"知"},{"weight":0.4345933810311881,"source":"人","target":"郷"},{"weight":0.07791843709245568,"source":"人","target":"惡"},{"weight":0.5887440608584463,"source":"人","target":"道"},{"weight":3.262892710284975,"source":"思","target":"弗"},{"weight":1.8765983491650844,"source":"思","target":"甚"},{"weight":2.34660197841082,"source":"知","target":"道"},{"weight":1.093839009915452,"source":"知","target":"郷"},{"weight":1.430311246536665,"source":"知","target":"放"},{"weight":2.7520670865189842,"source":"知","target":"求"},{"weight":1.430311246536665,"source":"知","target":"惡"},{"weight":3.039749158970765,"source":"放","target":"求"},{"weight":2.885598479143507,"source":"郷","target":"受"},{"weight":2.4155948498977713,"source":"郷","target":"死"},{"weight":2.7032769223495525,"source":"郷","target":"身"},{"weight":2.34660197841082,"source":"死","target":"惡"},{"weight":2.282063457273249,"source":"死","target":"甚"},{"weight":1.4711332410569202,"source":"死","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.7520670865189842,"source":"死","target":"受"},{"weight":2.56974552972503,"source":"死","target":"身"},{"weight":2.0589199059590393,"source":"甚","target":"惡"},{"weight":1.4711332410569202,"source":"甚","t